    "Study in Seasoned Cast Iron, Sepia Wash & Albumen.",
    rightCenter, wy + wh + 68, 11.5, 1.8, 0, subCol, 0.75
  );

  // Beneath Left Window: Patent & Library of Congress Notice
  const leftCenter = wxL + ww * 0.5;
  drawPrintedText(
    "Entered according to Act of Congress, in the year 1898,",
    leftCenter, wy + wh + 38, 10.5, 1.6, 0, subCol, 0.72
  );
  drawPrintedText(
    "in the Office of the Librarian of Congress at Washington.",
    leftCenter, wy + wh + 64, 10.5, 1.6, 0, subCol, 0.72
